{
  "_comment": "The grants of the agent actors this instance declares in scenarios/actors/ (deep-researcher, evidence-agent, onboarding-agent), as a W3C ODRL 2.2 Set. They moved here from the harness's default policy with the actors themselves (move M4): an actor's grants live beside the actor, so the harness's policy names no actor it does not declare. Each rule is the unscoped grant the actor held before; the @context and profile are the harness's, so the actions mean what its folio ODRL profile says. The harness's scenario overlay reads this directory with its own policies (checkoutPolicies / neededPolicies).",
